export function communicationText(key,args={}){const source=communicationAliases[key]??key;const value=communicationCopy[currentLocale()]?.[source]??uiText(key);return value.replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g,(m,k)=>Object.hasOwn(args,k)?String(args[k]):m);}

export function communicationDate(value){if(value==null||value==='')return '—';const date=new Date(value);return Number.isNaN(date.valueOf())?'—':new Intl.DateTimeFormat(currentLocale(),{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'}).format(date);}

export function communicationRelative(value){const date=new Date(value);if(Number.isNaN(date.valueOf()))return '';const minutes=Math.floor((Date.now()-date.valueOf())/60000),hours=Math.floor(minutes/60),days=Math.floor(hours/24);if(days>7)return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(currentLocale(),{month:'numeric',day:'numeric'}).format(date);const count=days>0?days:hours>0?hours:minutes;return count>0?count+(currentLocale()==='en-US'?' ':'')+communicationText(days>0?'chatDaysAgo':hours>0?'chatHoursAgo':'chatMinutesAgo'):communicationText('chatJustNow');}
